      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He reports that capturing the mutated wolf cost four rank three Gu Masters and at least over two hundred rank two Gu Masters, and that Wang tribe leader and Fang tribe leader’s timely reinforcement stopped its escape. He also notes the wolf’s old injuries and flatters Fang Yuan as blessed by Longevity Heaven. Fang Yuan forces the rank four wolf enslavement Gu onto him despite his rank three cultivation; as the Gu activates, a female sigh sounds, soul explosion erupts, and Tu Bo dies on the spot with a miserable cry.",
      "chapters": [
        504
      ],
